It's a variable, kind of like x and y in Algebra. It has no definition.
It's main purpose is as a replacement for "normal" gismu in examples, such
as in "lo broda" from my explanation of "lo". Basically, you can replace
"broda" with any selbri at all and the grammar is the same.

